{
 "file": "EN/EVENT_DATA/MESSAGE/E700/E747_001.BMD",
 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "MSG_000_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "It's finally just the two of us.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_000_5_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "It seems like Ann has been waiting[n]for me here...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_001_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "...Aren't you staring a little too much?[n]This isn't the first time you've seen me[n]in this.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_002_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "It's 'cause you're cute.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_002_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I'm entranced.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_002_0_0#2",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I wasn't staring.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_003_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Oh, come on...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_003_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "But... I'm glad to hear you say that,[n]so I guess I can let you off the hook.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_004_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Really?",
   "uk": "Справді?",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_004_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Huh...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_006_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Hey, let's go for a walk.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_007_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "...Ooh!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_007_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "I know that food stand![n]They sell garlic shrimp there!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_008_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "I've heard it's super delish![n]Come on, we should try it!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_009_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Sure.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "Звісно.[clr 27]",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_009_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "You'll get fat.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_009_0_0#2",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "If we split the bill.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_010_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "All right! I love that about you!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_012_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Don't worry! I'll watch my weight...[n]starting tomorrow!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_011_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Awww, but I didn't bring my wallet.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_011_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Oh shoot, I actually don't have it![n]Sorry, can you spot me?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_013_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Hi! Could I get two plates of[n]garlic shrimp, please?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_014_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Oh my god, it's so good!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_014_5_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "We gazed out over the ocean[n]while we enjoyed the delicate[n]flavors of a foreign country...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_015_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Shrimp Stand Owner",
   "en": "You two from Japan?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_016_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Huh? Oh yes, we are.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_017_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Shrimp Stand Owner",
   "en": "How 'bout them Phantom Thieves, huh?[n]The guys that steal hearts!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_018_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "You know about the Phantom Thieves!?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_019_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Shrimp Stand Owner",
   "en": "Heard about it on the news![n]They're all the rage in Japan, yeah?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_020_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "This is incredible!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_021_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Shrimp Stand Owner",
   "en": "Say, if y'run into 'em, tell 'em I say hello.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_021_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Shrimp Stand Owner",
   "en": "And ask 'em to change people's hearts[n]so everyone loves shrimp!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_022_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Well, I don't think that's really[n]how it works...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_023_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Let's go.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_023_5_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "We spent time on the beach until the[n]sun began to sink below the horizon...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_024_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "...It's beautiful.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_025_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "I told Shiho I wasn't into this cheesy[n]dating stuff...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_025_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "But now that I've actually tried it out...[n]it's really not that bad.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_026_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "I guess it's because I have someone[n]special to do it with.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_026_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "...Thanks.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_027_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I should be thanking you.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_027_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "You don't need to thank me.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_027_0_0#2",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I love you, Ann.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_028_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "*giggle*",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_028_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "...I love you.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_029_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "You're too uptight!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_030_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "*giggle*",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_031_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "...I love you too.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_032_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "...Here, you can have this.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_032_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "It'll help you remember how special[n]today was.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_032_5_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "It's a pair of dolls holding hands...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_032_5_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "One kind of reminds me of Ann,[n]while the other looks like me...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_033_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Hey, let's come back to Hawaii sometime.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_033_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "I mean... by ourselves.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_033_1_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Of course.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "Звісно.[clr 27]",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_033_1_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "It's a plan.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_033_3_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Yes!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_034_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Anyway, it's starting to get dark...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_034_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Should we head back?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_035_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Just a little longer.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_035_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "We're fine like this.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_036_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "...Okay.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_037_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "The two of us basked in the stunning[n]Hawaiian sunset. Just me and Ann...",
   "uk": "",
   "